Third-party components
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Bolt API's HTTP engine is a hard fork of the coroutine HTTP core from FasterAPI,
a predecessor project by the same author.

Bolt (https://github.com/Ugbot/bolt) is included as a git submodule under
extern/bolt and is covered by its own license. It is not distributed as part of
this source tree.

Bolt API links against OpenSSL (https://www.openssl.org/) for TLS, DTLS, and
cryptographic primitives, and optionally against zlib (https://zlib.net/) for
gzip response compression. These are external dependencies resolved at build
time; they are not vendored into this repository and remain under their own
licenses.

Portions of the QPACK implementation (include/boltapi/http3/) are derived from
the static table in RFC 9204 Appendix A and the Huffman code in RFC 7541
Appendix B.
